    <briefdescription>
<para>Cached block allocator that implements <ref refid="classcuda_1_1experimental_1_1stf_1_1block__allocator__interface" kindref="compound">block_allocator_interface</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This allocator uses an internal cache to reuse previously allocated memory blocks. The aim is to reduce the overhead of memory allocation. </para>
